<?xml version="1.0" encoding="UTF-8"?><rss version="2.0"><channel><title>HotNews — 中國，每一天。</title><description>Daily stories about China in technology, finance, sports, entertainment, lifestyle, science, travel and culture — for readers around the world.</description><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/</link><language>zh-TW</language><item><title>中國AI漫劇熱潮迎來首次大洗牌</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-ai-comic-drama-boom-meets/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-ai-comic-drama-boom-meets/</guid><description>中國AI生成的漫劇在八個月內暴增至超過38萬部，但平台支付下降引發42%的工作室退出。這場危機呼應了日本1980年代的動畫衰退，創作者正在尋找可持續的模式。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>entertainment</category><category>animation</category><category>film</category><category>technology</category><category>ai-comic-drama</category><category>china-streaming</category><category>digital</category><category>culture</category></item><item><title>中國票房熱潮：本土英雄與全球經典</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-box-office-buzz-local-heroes/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-box-office-buzz-local-heroes/</guid><description>中國影院本週推出多樣化片單，從歷史史詩《敦煌英雄》到昆汀·塔倫蒂諾的《追殺比爾》重映，同時新喜劇和驚悚片持續娛樂觀眾。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>film</category><category>box-office</category><category>entertainment</category><category>cinema</category><category>douban</category><category>dunhuang-heroes</category><category>the-odyssey</category><category>kill-bill</category></item><item><title>中國螢幕滿是故事——以及一場盛大的告別</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-screens-are-full-of-stories/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260925-entertainment-chinas-screens-are-full-of-stories/</guid><description>備受喜愛的中國演員游本昌以93歲高齡辭世，同時戲院裡充斥著來自中國大陸與好萊塢的新片，短篇AI動畫則湧入線上平台。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>entertainment</category><category>film</category><category>box-office</category><category>animation</category><category>culture</category><category>you-benchang</category><category>douban</category><category>chinese-cinema</category></item><item><title>中國A股兩年內增加7兆美元——那麼究竟是誰贏了？</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-chinas-a-shares-add-7-trillion-in/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-chinas-a-shares-add-7-trillion-in/</guid><description>自2024年9月以來，上海基準指數已上漲45%，市值增加約51兆元人民幣。然而許多普通投資者表示，他們在這波漲勢中幾乎沒有收穫，這個落差揭示了中國股市收益分配有多麼不均。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>finance</category><category>stocks</category><category>economy</category><category>shanghai</category><category>star-market</category><category>innovation</category><category>tencent</category><category>hong-kong-stocks</category></item><item><title>中國ETF市場創下新里程碑，債券基金規模突破1兆美元</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-chinas-etf-market-hits-new-milestone/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-chinas-etf-market-hits-new-milestone/</guid><description>中國債券交易所交易基金（ETF）首次突破1兆美元大關，同時針對創新藥物和軟體服務的新股票指數也相繼推出。這一里程碑反映出投資者對中國大陸市場多元化、低成本投資工具的需求日益增長。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>finance</category><category>stocks</category><category>economy</category><category>etf</category><category>shanghai</category><category>china-bonds</category><category>star-market</category><category>innovative-drugs</category></item><item><title>上海交易所將推出兩個新的科技導向股票指數</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-shanghai-exchange-to-launch-two-new/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/finance/20260925-finance-shanghai-exchange-to-launch-two-new/</guid><description>上海證券交易所和中國證券指數公司將於9月29日推出兩個新指數，涵蓋創新藥製造商和軟體服務。此舉為投資者提供了追蹤中國快速成長的生物科技和軟體產業的新工具。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>finance</category><category>stocks</category><category>healthcare</category><category>technology</category><category>shanghai</category><category>star-market</category><category>biotech</category><category>software</category></item><item><title>Jonathan Blow 全新解謎史詩《Order of the Sinking Star》售價 98 元</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260925-games-jonathan-blows-new-puzzle-epic-order/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/games/20260925-games-jonathan-blows-new-puzzle-epic-order/</guid><description>傳奇設計師 Jonathan Blow 的下一款遊戲《Order of the Sinking Star》將於 10 月 9 日在 PC、Switch 2 和 PS5 上推出。其中國售價 98 元，突顯全球工作室如今如何以區域定價爭取中國玩家。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>games</category><category>technology</category><category>entertainment</category><category>digital</category><category>jonathan-blow</category><category>order-of-the-sinking-star</category><category>steam</category><category>nintendo-switch-2</category></item><item><title>亞運：中國擊劍銅牌、桌球奪勝、滑板心碎</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260925-sports-asian-games-chinas-fencing-bronze-table/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260925-sports-asian-games-chinas-fencing-bronze-table/</guid><description>中國男子鈍劍隊以45-43惜敗日本，獲得銅牌，而桌球明星林詩棟和王楚欽晉級16強。滑板選手陳燁，衛冕冠軍，在男子公園決賽中墊底。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>sports</category><category>asian-games</category><category>table-tennis</category><category>fencing</category><category>skateboarding</category><category>badminton</category><category>hangzhou</category><category>lin-shidong</category></item><item><title>亞運：中國桌球男團決賽遭日本爆冷擊敗</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260925-sports-asian-games-chinas-table-tennis-men/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260925-sports-asian-games-chinas-table-tennis-men/</guid><description>日本在亞運桌球男團決賽以3比2險勝中國，張本智和贏下兩場比賽。中國仍在射擊項目摘金並在單打晉級，擊劍隊則獲得銅牌。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>sports</category><category>table-tennis</category><category>asian-games</category><category>japan</category><category>harimoto</category><category>wang-chuqin</category><category>shooting</category><category>badminton</category></item><item><title>亞運第二天：中國射擊與桌球選手在杭州閃耀</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260925-sports-asian-games-day-two-chinas-shooters/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/sports/20260925-sports-asian-games-day-two-chinas-shooters/</guid><description>中國在杭州亞運會射擊項目再添金牌，並讓桌球明星晉級，而男子擊劍隊僅獲銅牌，滑板衛冕冠軍則滑落至第八名。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>sports</category><category>asian-games</category><category>table-tennis</category><category>hangzhou</category><category>shooting</category><category>skateboarding</category><category>badminton</category><category>wang-chuqin</category></item><item><title>中國手機巨頭 Infinix 推出全球首款遊戲控制器與散熱底座</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-chinese-phone-giant-infinix-unveils-world-first/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-chinese-phone-giant-infinix-unveils-world-first/</guid><description>Infinix 是總部位於深圳的傳音旗下專攻遊戲的品牌，現推出兩款 GT NX 配件：一款搭載全球首創像素級精準觸控板、適合射擊遊戲的控制器，以及一款內建熱電致冷技術的底座。此次發布顯示中國低調的手機巨頭正積極進軍高利潤的行動遊戲周邊設備市場。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>games</category><category>innovation</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>infinix</category><category>transsion</category><category>mobile-gaming</category><category>gaming-accessories</category></item><item><title>次世代記憶體突破：100億次讀寫循環</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-next-gen-memory-breakthrough-10-billion-read-write/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-next-gen-memory-breakthrough-10-billion-read-write/</guid><description>一個由中國主導的研究團隊表示，他們已修復鐵電記憶體的耐久性缺陷，使元件突破100億次讀寫循環。這項進展可能讓更快、更省電的儲存技術更接近日常晶片。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>research</category><category>innovation</category><category>digital</category><category>xidian-university</category><category>ferroelectric-memory</category><category>semiconductors</category><category>hong-kong</category></item><item><title>特斯拉以發光燈條預告新款Roadster，將於十月首次亮相</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-tesla-teases-new-roadster-with-glowing/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-tesla-teases-new-roadster-with-glowing/</guid><description>特斯拉發布了第二代Roadster的另一個預告，僅展示了一條前LED燈條。這款電動超級跑車將於北京時間10月2日全面亮相。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>tesla</category><category>roadster</category><category>innovation</category><category>automotive</category></item><item><title>宇樹創辦人稱機器人面臨毫米級挑戰</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-unitree-founder-says-robots-face-a/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/tech/20260925-tech-unitree-founder-says-robots-face-a/</guid><description>在杭州全球數字貿易博覽會上，宇樹創辦人王興興認為人形機器人仍缺乏實際工作的精度，並預測一旦它們能處理陌生空間，具身人工智慧將迎來「ChatGPT時刻」。</description><pubDate>Fri, 25 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>innovation</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>hangzhou</category><category>unitree</category><category>robotics</category><category>embodied-ai</category><category>wang-xingxing</category></item><item><title>AI 主導精密投資詐騙</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-ai-takes-over-sophisticated-investment-scams/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-ai-takes-over-sophisticated-investment-scams/</guid><description>中國投資者面臨新一波 AI 驅動的金融詐騙，因人工智慧能實現更精密的「養豬騙局」，誘騙受害者轉帳大筆資金。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>economy</category><category>finance</category><category>daily-life</category><category>artificial-intelligence</category><category>fraud</category><category>investment</category><category>cybersecurity</category></item><item><title>中國音響設備在東南亞大放異彩</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-audio-gear-makes-big-noise/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-audio-gear-makes-big-noise/</guid><description>從深圳的小店到東南亞每月50萬銷量，中國音響品牌正透過調整產品以滿足當地消費者需求，在海外蓬勃發展。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>exports</category><category>technology</category><category>innovation</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>daily-life</category><category>shenzhen</category><category>southeast-asia</category><category>audio</category></item><item><title>中國汽車業迎來新轉型</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-auto-industry-faces-new-turn/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-auto-industry-faces-new-turn/</guid><description>四個信號表明，在中國汽車業，市場力量正在重塑競爭格局，行業即將進入新的整合階段。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>exports</category><category>innovation</category><category>economy</category><category>automotive</category><category>new-energy-vehicles</category><category>autonomous-driving</category></item><item><title>中國鋰電池繁榮面臨石墨挑戰</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-lithium-battery-boom-faces-graphite/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-lithium-battery-boom-faces-graphite/</guid><description>中國鋰電池產業宣布擴建74萬噸，同時擔憂石墨供應瓶頸可能影響電動車生產。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>innovation</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>technology</category><category>economy</category><category>lithium-battery</category><category>graphite</category><category>supply-chain</category></item><item><title>中國智慧手機巨頭轉換晶片供應商</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-smartphone-giants-switch-chip-suppliers/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-chinas-smartphone-giants-switch-chip-suppliers/</guid><description>中國主要手機製造商OPPO和vivo出人意料地轉向使用MediaTek晶片旗艦型號，標示著在激烈競爭中產業的轉變。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>technology</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>exports</category><category>economy</category><category>oppo</category><category>vivo</category><category>mediatek</category></item><item><title>鋰電池市場：現實與炒作的碰撞</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-lithium-battery-market-reality-meets-hype/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/autos/20260924-autos-lithium-battery-market-reality-meets-hype/</guid><description>儘管市場擔憂供過於求，鋰電池仍然供不應求。隨著需求持續增長，兩個關鍵的供應因素被低估了。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>electric-vehicles</category><category>manufacturing</category><category>innovation</category><category>economy</category><category>technology</category><category>lithium-battery</category><category>energy-storage</category><category>renewable-energy</category></item><item><title>現代中國茶文化傳統</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/culture/20260924-culture-chinese-tea-traditions-in-modern-times/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/culture/20260924-culture-chinese-tea-traditions-in-modern-times/</guid><description>古老的中國茶儀式正隨著當代生活方式演變，融合千年傳統與現代創新，創造新的文化體驗。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>tradition</category><category>culture</category><category>lifestyle</category><category>daily-life</category><category>innovation</category><category>tea</category><category>shanghai</category><category>beijing</category></item><item><title>傳統遇見數位：中國數位博物館的興起</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/culture/20260924-culture-traditional-meets-digital-chinas-digital-museum/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/culture/20260924-culture-traditional-meets-digital-chinas-digital-museum/</guid><description>中國的文化機構正採納數位技術來保存和分享古代文物給全球觀眾，創造跨越千年的沉浸式體驗。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>culture</category><category>innovation</category><category>tradition</category><category>technology</category><category>museums</category><category>palace-museum</category><category>national-museum-of-china</category><category>shanghai-museum</category></item><item><title>38萬部AI短劇之後：中國動畫淘金熱撞上現實</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260924-entertainment-380000-ai-dramas-later-chinas-animation/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260924-entertainment-380000-ai-dramas-later-chinas-animation/</guid><description>今年，製作方將數十萬部AI生成的動畫微短劇傾瀉到中國各大平台，結果卻眼睜睜看著分潤縮水、工作室接連倒閉。隨著泡沫消退，倖存者正從日本1980年代動畫熱潮中尋找前進的方向。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>entertainment</category><category>animation</category><category>digital</category><category>technology</category><category>ai-generated-content</category><category>short-dramas</category><category>streaming-platforms</category><category>japan-anime</category></item><item><title>中國動產業捕捉全球想像力</title><link>https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260924-entertainment-chinas-animation-industry-captures-global-imagination-x/</link><guid isPermaLink="true">https://hotnews.pub/zh-TW/entertainment/20260924-entertainment-chinas-animation-industry-captures-global-imagination-x/</guid><description>中國動產業正快速從國內娛樂轉向國際讚譽，將傳統文化元素與尖端技術相結合，創造出具有全球吸引力的內容。</description><pubDate>Thu, 24 Sep 2026 00:00:00 GMT</pubDate><category>animation</categor